Knowledge is the equivalent of an experience system in [[Worlds Adrift]]. Knowledge can be gained by using your [[Gauntlet]]'s Forge Scanner (Default {{Key|4}}) on ancient [[Data banks|Databanks]] which scattered over islands. In addition, you can scan island objects for small bits of knowledge and collect [[Codex|Lore pieces (codices)]] for 15, 25, 50, or 100 knowledge apiece.

== Uses ==
[[File:KnowledgeTree.png|frameless|right|700px|link=]]
Knowledge is used in the Knowledge Tree to learn schematics or unlock crafting slots. When the player has enough knowledge to research a new item, the node will turn blue.

