=== Schematic Slots ===
Increases by 1 the amount of schematics you can have learned in '''each''' category, Clothing, Cooking, Ship Parts, Utility, and Crafting Components.<br>
The cost starts at 50 and increases by 10 for each slot researched up to a maximum of 100 extra slots.

